Root cause:
The bug was caused by a change in the server indexing logic introduced in commit b4db3be86e, which moved the indexing process into the server template loop. As a result, the first server was not indexed because the loop started at low + 1, focusing only on duplicating servers, thereby skipping the first server entirely.

